  "narrative": [
    "To continue within the major, all students must pass Music 2C or an equivalent proficiency exam.",
    "All required music major courses must be taken for a letter grade, with the exception of MUS 143, which is taken on a Pass/Not Pass basis. All courses to be counted toward satisfying the major requirements must be passed with a grade of C or better.",
    "Jazz emphasis students take MUS 2JK in lieu of 2CK.",
    "All transfer students must pass a proficiency examination in MUS 2C. Basic Musicianship, and MUS 2CK. Basic Keyboard, or take the two sequence courses.",
    "Area of Emphasis: 'Any three courses from the following' areas (Composition, Performance, Jazz and the African Diaspora, Technology, Literature); read as three courses within one area."
